    "Started in good",
    "season, walking out",
    "to the East Branch of",
    "the Penobscot, which we",
    "crossed, & then drove to",
    "Island Falls. I have",
    "enjoyed the trip ex-",
    "-ceedingly; the boys",
    "are most pleasant",
    "companions."
